{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34015","headline":"寒日书斋即事三首 一 · 皮日休","name":"寒日书斋即事三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"参佐三间似草堂，恬然无事可成忙。\n移时寂历烧松子，尽日殷勤拂乳牀。\n将近道斋先衣褐，欲清诗思更焚香。\n空庭好待中宵月，独礼星辰学步罡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}